<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Blog</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div id="login-container">
        <h2>Enter Passcode</h2>
        <input type="password" id="passcode" placeholder="Type passcode" required>
        <button onclick="checkPasscode()">Unlock</button>
        <p id="error-message" class="error"></p>
    </div>

    <div id="blog-content" style="display: none;">
        <header>
            <h1>My Blog</h1>
            <p>Welcome to my thoughts and ideas</p>
        </header>
        <main>
            <article>
                <h2>First Post: Getting Started</h2>
                <p class="date">Posted on February 21, 2025</p>
                <p>This is my first blog post! I’m excited to share my journey as I learn to code and build things. Today, I made this blog with help from Grok. Stay tuned for more!</p>
            </article>
            <article>
                <h2>Second Post: Ideas for the Future</h2>
                <p class="date">Posted on February 20, 2025</p>
                <p>I’m thinking about adding more features to this blog, like a comment section or a dark mode toggle. What do you think? For now, it’s just a simple static site.</p>
            </article>
        </main>
        <footer>
            <p>© 2025 CESAR . Hosted on <a href="https://github.com/[your-username]">GitHub</a>.</p>
        </footer>
        <button id="back-to-top" onclick="scrollToTop()">Back to Top</button>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
